{"t":"Coconut Shrimp Bake","s":"coconut-shrimp-bake-7f678","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Coconut_Shrimp_Bake_d4fbe3.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Coconut Shrimp Bake</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Coconut Shrimp Bake\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Coconut_Shrimp_Bake_d4fbe3.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plants, Animal Products, Food and Drink<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">20.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2,000 - 20,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"regenseconds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Regeneration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0 seconds<br/><small>(0% full)</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.60<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 30, 2010<br/>Summer Update 2010</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20210713213646&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Coconut_Shrimp_Bake_d4fbe3.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a coconut shrimp bake.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 20.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It looks as if it was sealed with milky goodness.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Yum.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It will boost your underwater speed by 300 speed levels for 24 hours while wearing a <a href=\"#/wiki/Helmet%20of%20the%20Deep\">Helmet of the Deep</a> or a <a href=\"#/wiki/Depth%20Galea\">Depth Galea</a>. The duration of the 24 hours is not dependent on you wearing the helmet, hunting or even being online.\n</p><p>It can only be eaten when wearing a <a href=\"#/wiki/Helmet%20of%20the%20Deep\">Helmet of the Deep</a> or a <a href=\"#/wiki/Depth%20Galea\">Depth Galea</a>, otherwise you'll get the following message: \"<span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">You should only eat this dish when wearing a helmet of the deep or a depth galea and walking underwater.</span>\" Note that you don't need to be underwater in order to eat this dish.\n</p><p>When successfully using a Coconut Shrimp Bake, Green Sparkles Effect <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Green Sparkles Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Sparkles_Effect_f26b9f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> will appear on the user who will get the following message: \"<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Your underwater walking speed while wearing a &lt;helmet of the deep/depth galea&gt; has increased for twenty-four hours.</span>\" Although this message mentions only one of the diving helmets, both will be affected by this dish's effect.\n</p><p>To create this dish, you must speak with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Djinn\">Djinn</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Jean%20Pierre\">Jean Pierre</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>, near the Marid Fortress, during the Hot Cuisine event.\n</p><p><b>Necessary Ingredients:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">Vials</a> of <a href=\"#/wiki/Coconut%20Milk\">Coconut Milk</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Coconut%20Milk\"><img alt=\"Coconut Milk\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Coconut_Milk_f8bb14.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Brown%20Mushroom\">Brown Mushrooms</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Brown%20Mushroom\"><img alt=\"Brown Mushroom\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Brown_Mushroom_c68d05.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Mushroom\">Red Mushrooms</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Mushroom\"><img alt=\"Red Mushroom\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Red_Mushroom_5b1645.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Rice%20Ball\">Rice Balls</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Rice%20Ball\"><img alt=\"Rice Ball\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rice_Ball_02073c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Shrimp\">Shrimps</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Shrimp\"><img alt=\"Shrimp\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shrimp_374461.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li></ul>\n<p>Obtainable through the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>The dish is one of the four winning recipes of the Gourmet Competition held by CipSoft in May 2010. The creator of this recipe is Natalya Rimsky.\n</p><p>It is much less useful than it initially was because underwater walking speed was increased with the Winter Update 2012 which also decreased the relative character speed (for characters higher than level 175).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brown%20Mushroom\">Brown Mushroom</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Coconut%20Milk\">Coconut Milk</a></li><li>Deep Sea Diver</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Depth%20Galea\">Depth Galea</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></li><li>Haste (Condition)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Helmet%20of%20the%20Deep\">Helmet of the Deep</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Mushroom\">Red Mushroom</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rice%20Ball\">Rice Ball</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shrimp\">Shrimp</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/twenty-miles-beneath-the-sea-quest\">Twenty Miles Beneath the Sea Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">Vial</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["hot-cuisine-quest","twenty-miles-beneath-the-sea-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"hot-cuisine-quest","quest":"Hot Cuisine Quest","step":"3-0","n":18,"title":"Prato 11: Coconut Shrimp Bake","kind":"reward","coords":[{"x":33068,"y":32531,"z":6,"label":"Jean Pierre"}]},{"slug":"hot-cuisine-quest","quest":"Hot Cuisine Quest","step":"4-0","n":24,"title":"Efeitos dos pratos","kind":"reward","coords":[]},{"slug":"twenty-miles-beneath-the-sea-quest","quest":"Twenty Miles Beneath the Sea Quest","kind":"needed","qty":null}]}}